==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|enm|en}} {{m|enm|spedily}}, {{m|enm|spedili}}, from {{etyl|ang|en}} {{m|ang|*spēdiġlīċe}}, {{m|ang|ġespēdiġlīċe||prosperously}}, equivalent to {{suffix|speedy|ly|lang=en}}. Cognate with {{etyl|sco|-}} {{m|sco|spedely}}, {{m|sco|spedelie||quickly, speedily}}. Compare also {{etyl|ang|-}} {{m|ang|spēdlīċe||effectually, effectively, successfully, efficaciously, powerfully, in a manner which produces a result}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈspiːdɪli/|lang=en}}

===Adverb===
{{en-adv|er|more}}

# In a [[speedy]] or [[fast]] manner.

